        },
        {
          "text": " Ogwo niwe kumurinkana kw'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga kandi ekishushani kye buzima, kandi niwe ahigika byona n'ekigambo kye eky'obushoboorozi. Ku yaaherize kuhikiiriza eky'okwozyaho ebibi, yaashutama aha rubaju rwa buryo orw'Ow'ekitiinisa omu iguru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
